load @term/seed/code/algebra/c-star
  find c-star-algebra

# A von Neumann algebra: a C-star algebra of operators closed in the weak operator topology, the setting for quantum
# statistical mechanics and the classification of factors. It is where infinite quantum systems and their symmetries are
# studied. The form carries the underlying C-star algebra; the weak closure is the added condition.
form von-neumann-algebra
  link algebra, like c-star-algebra
